==Battleground==
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Box Witch and Minions]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
**5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Even on {{3c}}, this stage is essentially an easier EoC chapter 3 moon. Even with the Metal Hippoes sucking up damage, Box Witch and Minions poses very little threat to your units. Bring a lineup you would for that stage, subbing [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] for [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]], and you're golden.

